{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And the ram he cut into its pieces.</b> Cutting (ניתוח) takes place only after flaying, but he abbreviated regarding the flaying here, because he had already commanded concerning this in the section of the burnt offering (Leviticus 1:6). And he said, \"And Moses burned the head and the pieces,\" at the time of burning, and this is after \"and the inwards and the legs he washed with water,\" and this is why he said, \"And Moses burned the whole ram,\" for he burned everything as one after the washing, but he separated them to teach that the pieces do not require washing."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:51:45.033911481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}